# Allowlist, not a blocklist. This repo is mostly a Unity project — Library/
# alone runs to gigabytes — and none of it belongs in the relay image. Naming
# things to exclude would silently rot the first time a new Unity folder
# appears; naming the two things to include cannot.

*
!relay
!controller

# node_modules is rebuilt inside the image by npm ci, and the host copy is the
# wrong platform anyway.
relay/node_modules
